{
  "name": "Titanbound",
  "type": "class",
  "img": "art/bbttcc/GOTTGAIT/BBTTCC_Character_Options/New%20Classes/Titanbound.png",
  "system": {
    "identifier": "titanbound",
    "description": {
      "value": "<h2 data-start=\"445\" data-end=\"463\">🗿 TITANBOUND</h2><p data-start=\"464\" data-end=\"499\"><strong data-start=\"464\" data-end=\"484\">Primary Ability:</strong> Constitution</p><blockquote data-start=\"501\" data-end=\"552\"><p data-start=\"503\" data-end=\"552\"><em data-start=\"503\" data-end=\"552\">“You do not wear armor.<br data-start=\"527\" data-end=\"530\" />You are the armor.”</em></p></blockquote><p data-start=\"554\" data-end=\"744\">Titanbound are not agile defenders or clever duelists. They are not built to avoid danger. They are built to <strong data-start=\"663\" data-end=\"676\">absorb it</strong>, <strong data-start=\"678\" data-end=\"689\">hold it</strong>, and decide—slowly and deliberately—what breaks first.</p><p data-start=\"746\" data-end=\"963\">Where others react to violence, a Titanbound <strong data-start=\"791\" data-end=\"804\">stores it</strong>. Where others reposition, a Titanbound <strong data-start=\"844\" data-end=\"863\">refuses to move</strong>. The battlefield learns to plan around them, because nothing short of catastrophe makes them budge.</p><p data-start=\"965\" data-end=\"1148\">Titanbound fight by turning pressure into structure. They let blows land. They let the world push. And then, when the moment is right, they spend everything they’ve been holding back.</p><p data-start=\"1113\" data-end=\"1224\">Titanbound are not tanks because they are hard to hit.<br data-start=\"1167\" data-end=\"1170\" />They are tanks because <strong data-start=\"1193\" data-end=\"1223\">hitting them was a mistake</strong>.</p><p data-start=\"1226\" data-end=\"1424\">Where others react, you <em data-start=\"1250\" data-end=\"1262\">accumulate</em>.<br data-start=\"1263\" data-end=\"1266\" />Where others maneuver, you <em data-start=\"1293\" data-end=\"1301\">commit</em>.<br data-start=\"1302\" data-end=\"1305\" />You turn pressure, force, and refusal to yield into a stored resource — and then spend it to decide how the fight ends.</p><p data-start=\"1426\" data-end=\"1445\">You are not a wall.</p><p data-start=\"1447\" data-end=\"1486\">You are the load-bearing failure point.</p><hr data-start=\"1488\" data-end=\"1491\" /><h2 data-start=\"1493\" data-end=\"1541\">🔩 Core Class Feature — Titan Frame (Level 1)</h2><p data-start=\"1543\" data-end=\"1599\">Titanbound operate on a unique resource: <strong data-start=\"1584\" data-end=\"1598\">Frame Dice</strong>.</p><p data-start=\"1601\" data-end=\"1722\">Frame Dice represent <strong data-start=\"1622\" data-end=\"1657\">stored structural inevitability</strong> — the force you have accepted, absorbed, or refused to yield to.</p><h3 data-start=\"1724\" data-end=\"1744\">Titan Frame Dice</h3><ul data-start=\"1745\" data-end=\"1981\"><li data-start=\"1745\" data-end=\"1779\"><p data-start=\"1747\" data-end=\"1779\">You begin with <strong data-start=\"1762\" data-end=\"1779\">d6 Frame Dice</strong></p></li><li data-start=\"1780\" data-end=\"1882\"><p data-start=\"1782\" data-end=\"1815\">Your Frame Die size increases at:</p><ul data-start=\"1818\" data-end=\"1882\"><li data-start=\"1818\" data-end=\"1836\"><p data-start=\"1820\" data-end=\"1836\"><strong data-start=\"1820\" data-end=\"1836\">Level 5 → d8</strong></p></li><li data-start=\"1839\" data-end=\"1859\"><p data-start=\"1841\" data-end=\"1859\"><strong data-start=\"1841\" data-end=\"1859\">Level 11 → d10</strong></p></li><li data-start=\"1862\" data-end=\"1882\"><p data-start=\"1864\" data-end=\"1882\"><strong data-start=\"1864\" data-end=\"1882\">Level 17 → d12</strong></p></li></ul></li><li data-start=\"1883\" data-end=\"1981\"><p data-start=\"1885\" data-end=\"1981\"><strong data-start=\"1885\" data-end=\"1907\">Maximum Frame Dice</strong> you can hold at one time =<br data-start=\"1934\" data-end=\"1937\" /><strong data-start=\"1939\" data-end=\"1981\">your Constitution modifier (minimum 1)</strong></p></li></ul><p data-start=\"1983\" data-end=\"2072\">You are not meant to hoard Frame forever.<br data-start=\"2024\" data-end=\"2027\" />Pressure that is not released becomes stress.</p><hr data-start=\"2074\" data-end=\"2077\" /><h2 data-start=\"2079\" data-end=\"2100\">Gaining Frame Dice</h2><p data-start=\"2102\" data-end=\"2172\">You may gain <strong data-start=\"2115\" data-end=\"2130\">1 Frame Die</strong> when <strong data-start=\"2136\" data-end=\"2147\">any one</strong> of the following occurs:</p><ul data-start=\"2174\" data-end=\"2391\"><li data-start=\"2174\" data-end=\"2243\"><p data-start=\"2176\" data-end=\"2243\">You take damage equal to or greater than your <strong data-start=\"2222\" data-end=\"2243\">Proficiency Bonus</strong></p></li><li data-start=\"2244\" data-end=\"2310\"><p data-start=\"2246\" data-end=\"2310\">You are subjected to forced movement, <strong data-start=\"2284\" data-end=\"2310\">but choose not to move</strong></p></li><li data-start=\"2311\" data-end=\"2391\"><p data-start=\"2313\" data-end=\"2391\">A hostile effect <strong data-start=\"2330\" data-end=\"2339\">fails</strong> to knock you prone, restrain you, or reposition you</p></li></ul><p data-start=\"2393\" data-end=\"2486\">⚠️ <strong data-start=\"2396\" data-end=\"2406\">Limit:</strong> You may only gain <strong data-start=\"2425\" data-end=\"2450\">1 Frame Die per round</strong>, no matter how many triggers occur.</p><p data-start=\"2488\" data-end=\"2560\">This is intentional.<br data-start=\"2508\" data-end=\"2511\" />You are not a battery — you are a pressure valve.</p><hr data-start=\"2562\" data-end=\"2565\" /><h2 data-start=\"2567\" data-end=\"2589\">Spending Frame Dice</h2><p data-start=\"2591\" data-end=\"2654\">You may spend Frame Dice to exert control over the battlefield.</p><p data-start=\"2656\" data-end=\"2676\">Common uses include:</p><ul data-start=\"2678\" data-end=\"2982\"><li data-start=\"2678\" data-end=\"2784\"><p data-start=\"2680\" data-end=\"2784\"><strong data-start=\"2680\" data-end=\"2697\">Reduce damage</strong> you take<br data-start=\"2706\" data-end=\"2709\" /><em data-start=\"2711\" data-end=\"2784\">(Roll the Frame Die + your Constitution modifier, subtract from damage)</em></p></li><li data-start=\"2786\" data-end=\"2857\"><p data-start=\"2788\" data-end=\"2815\"><strong data-start=\"2788\" data-end=\"2809\">Enhance an attack</strong> with:</p><ul data-start=\"2818\" data-end=\"2857\"><li data-start=\"2818\" data-end=\"2835\"><p data-start=\"2820\" data-end=\"2835\">Forced movement</p></li><li data-start=\"2838\" data-end=\"2857\"><p data-start=\"2840\" data-end=\"2857\">Knockdown (prone)</p></li></ul></li><li data-start=\"2859\" data-end=\"2889\"><p data-start=\"2861\" data-end=\"2889\"><strong data-start=\"2861\" data-end=\"2889\">Ignore difficult terrain</strong></p></li><li data-start=\"2890\" data-end=\"2928\"><p data-start=\"2892\" data-end=\"2928\"><strong data-start=\"2892\" data-end=\"2928\">Negate or resist forced movement</strong></p></li><li data-start=\"2929\" data-end=\"2982\"><p data-start=\"2931\" data-end=\"2982\"><strong data-start=\"2931\" data-end=\"2940\">Brace</strong> against effects that would reposition you</p></li></ul><p data-start=\"2984\" data-end=\"3052\">Subclass features expand and specialize how Frame Dice can be spent.</p><hr data-start=\"3054\" data-end=\"3057\" /><h2 data-start=\"3059\" data-end=\"3099\">⚠ Structural Stress — Pushback System</h2><p data-start=\"3101\" data-end=\"3167\">Titanbound do not bend freely.<br data-start=\"3131\" data-end=\"3134\" />Reality invoices you for refusal.</p><p data-start=\"3169\" data-end=\"3205\">You gain <strong data-start=\"3178\" data-end=\"3199\">Structural Stress</strong> when:</p><ul data-start=\"3207\" data-end=\"3368\"><li data-start=\"3207\" data-end=\"3254\"><p data-start=\"3209\" data-end=\"3254\">You would gain Frame Dice beyond your maximum</p></li><li data-start=\"3255\" data-end=\"3301\"><p data-start=\"3257\" data-end=\"3301\">You end your turn with <strong data-start=\"3280\" data-end=\"3301\">unused Frame Dice</strong></p></li><li data-start=\"3302\" data-end=\"3368\"><p data-start=\"3304\" data-end=\"3368\">You negate massive damage outright or overrule a powerful effect</p></li></ul><p data-start=\"3370\" data-end=\"3447\">Stress represents micro-fractures, metaphysical load, and accumulated strain.</p><h3 data-start=\"3449\" data-end=\"3470\">Stress Thresholds</h3><p data-start=\"3472\" data-end=\"3526\">As Structural Stress increases, consequences escalate:</p><ul data-start=\"3528\" data-end=\"3771\"><li data-start=\"3528\" data-end=\"3586\"><p data-start=\"3530\" data-end=\"3586\"><strong data-start=\"3530\" data-end=\"3542\">Cracked:</strong><br data-start=\"3542\" data-end=\"3545\" />Disadvantage on Dexterity saving throws</p></li><li data-start=\"3588\" data-end=\"3630\"><p data-start=\"3590\" data-end=\"3630\"><strong data-start=\"3590\" data-end=\"3603\">Buckling:</strong><br data-start=\"3603\" data-end=\"3606\" />Speed reduced by 10 ft</p></li><li data-start=\"3632\" data-end=\"3690\"><p data-start=\"3634\" data-end=\"3690\"><strong data-start=\"3634\" data-end=\"3648\">Fractured:</strong><br data-start=\"3648\" data-end=\"3651\" />Titan abilities cost <strong data-start=\"3674\" data-end=\"3690\">+1 Frame Die</strong></p></li><li data-start=\"3692\" data-end=\"3771\"><p data-start=\"3694\" data-end=\"3709\"><strong data-start=\"3694\" data-end=\"3707\">Collapse:</strong></p><ul data-start=\"3712\" data-end=\"3771\"><li data-start=\"3712\" data-end=\"3735\"><p data-start=\"3714\" data-end=\"3735\">Lose all Frame Dice</p></li><li data-start=\"3738\" data-end=\"3771\"><p data-start=\"3740\" data-end=\"3771\">You are <strong data-start=\"3748\" data-end=\"3771\">stunned for 1 round</strong></p></li></ul></li></ul><p data-start=\"3773\" data-end=\"3795\">Stress can be cleared:</p><ul data-start=\"3796\" data-end=\"3913\"><li data-start=\"3796\" data-end=\"3827\"><p data-start=\"3798\" data-end=\"3827\">Partially on a <strong data-start=\"3813\" data-end=\"3827\">short rest</strong></p></li><li data-start=\"3828\" data-end=\"3854\"><p data-start=\"3830\" data-end=\"3854\">Fully on a <strong data-start=\"3841\" data-end=\"3854\">long rest</strong></p></li><li data-start=\"3855\" data-end=\"3913\"><p data-start=\"3857\" data-end=\"3913\">Via subclass features that deliberately release pressure</p></li></ul><p data-start=\"3915\" data-end=\"4011\">You are not punished for standing firm.<br data-start=\"3954\" data-end=\"3957\" />You are punished for pretending you can do it forever.</p><hr data-start=\"4013\" data-end=\"4016\" /><h1 data-start=\"4018\" data-end=\"4044\">🏗 Titanbound Subclasses</h1><p data-start=\"4046\" data-end=\"4106\">At <strong data-start=\"4049\" data-end=\"4060\">Level 3</strong>, you choose how your inevitability manifests.</p><p data-start=\"4108\" data-end=\"4179\">Each Titanbound subclass represents a different answer to the question:</p><p data-start=\"4181\" data-end=\"4205\"><strong data-start=\"4181\" data-end=\"4205\">“What breaks first?”</strong></p><hr data-start=\"4207\" data-end=\"4210\" /><p data-start=\"4236\" data-end=\"4303\"></p>\n<hr /><p><strong>BBTTCC Resource Actions:</strong> This patched class JSON grants Features-tab resource display/action items at level 1 for the runtime resource-action engine.</p>",
      "chat": ""
    },
